# 実データ・生成物は許可リストに入っていても公開しない（*.example.json は上で許可済み）
scripts/*/data/*.json
scripts/*/art/**
scripts/**/__pycache__/**

# Optional concept-game music is outside the initial core release.
scripts/dashboard_assets/bgm/**

# Tests stay in private development; core packaging has its own verified boot gate.
scripts/test_*.py

# Logo prototypes and their previews are design scratch, not part of the release (Ren, 2026-10-07).
scripts/dashboard_assets/logo_prototypes/**

# Credentials live outside the vault (beside the repository); if a copy ever lands here, never commit it.
/shuki-secrets/
